  "photographic_reading": [
    "Indexed current name 西园公寓 and historical 西园大厦 are the same registered building. The other 1382 block, garden, modern frontage along Yuyuan Road and businesses observed on Changning Road are distinct.",
    "2014 courtyard view has tall flanking tower bays, two surviving open pergolas, six small upper windows on the level directly above the three broad shallow balcony arches, with a final flat-headed row above. At several apartment openings the previously open balconies are now enclosed by private window frames.",
    "An early plate has six clear round arches where the 2014 image shows small, partially lowered rectangular openings. It establishes the facade rhythm and the position of the pergolas. Individual apartment closures vary.",
    "Two 2021 dated road views confirm a narrow center pier between two upper-level lightwells. Low additions and shop fronts obscure both wells at ground level. Two separate estimated low fills respect the mapped building footprint. The visible frontage lines do not establish their rear limits, exact heights or the identity of each shop.",
    "District planning records published 2021 and 2023 give 1928, and the architect-research page gives 1927–1928. The secondary inventory gives 1912 and the PastVu upload description assigns 1926 and a different architect. The disputed dates and attributions are not used to alter model geometry.",
    "The complete municipal row and historic photos are linked. No claim is made that the 2014/2021 envelope depicts private post-renovation window changes."
  ],
